  source_id "chronicle_1770629010307_c5g7hh"
  title "The Dead God's Jaw"
  summary "Grandfather Blood, a scarred orca, descends through a transforming underwater corridor of ice and mineral into the depths, guided by visions of a dead god and haunted by the memory of three lost mining teams. As he penetrates deeper, the Twilight-bells embedded in his body resonate with an ancient scream from a catastrophic rupture at Sleek☽ Caemomot, fragmenting his consciousness into multiple selves before a crystalline shard reunites him and grants him a glimpse of the true deep where fire, ice, and the dead god's body are indistinguishable. Returning to ordinary water, Grandfather Blood carries a permanent shard in his empty eye socket—a mark of communion with the dead god that dwells not below but is the below itself, forever binding him to the ice and the depths."
